## Evidence inspected for this pass

- [California Department of Conservation, Williamson Act FAQ](https://www.conservation.ca.gov/dlrp/wa/Documents/Williamson%20Act%20FAQ%202024.pdf) and [IRS, Conservation Easements](https://www.irs.gov/charities-non-profits/conservation-easements): property-specific assessment versus a conditional federal income-tax deduction.
- [Grounded Solutions Network](https://groundedsolutions.org/strengthening-neighborhoods/community-land-trusts/): typical homeownership structure, renewable 99-year leases, and restricted resale; not every possible agricultural tenure.
- [Land Report, January 2021 newsletter](https://landreport.com/newsletters/LR_Newsletter_January 2021.pdf) and [Nuveen farmland](https://www.nuveen.com/global/investment-capabilities/real-assets/farmland): dated original holdings estimate and manager-described portfolio. State counts differed between the original and secondary accounts, so that unnecessary detail was removed.
- [Shumailov et al.](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-07566-y) and [Kiwix FAQ](https://get.kiwix.org/en/faq/): conditional model-collapse mechanism and actual archive-edition differences.
- [FAO Technical Paper 531](https://www.fao.org/4/i1141e/i1141e00.htm) and its indexed algae chapter: aquaculture feed uses vary by species and inclusion level. This does not validate SECTOR 07's prototype. The builder video was throttled during this pass; its inherited output figure is now explicitly attributed, not independently recertified.
- [Meshtastic encryption](https://meshtastic.org/docs/overview/encryption/) and [Semtech LoRa](https://www.semtech.com/lora/what-is-lora): public shared-channel keys and physical radio technology; no promise of authenticated private-group identity.
- [California Universal Meals](https://www.cde.ca.gov/ls/nu/sn/cauniversalmeals.asp) and [CalRecycle Food Recovery](https://calrecycle.ca.gov/organics/slcp/foodrecovery/): actual school scope/days and a statutory target, not proof of target attainment.
- [GAO AIMD-00-125](https://www.gao.gov/products/aimd-00-125): recommendation-status updates explicitly record April 2004 independent validation procedures. Preserved as a checked non-error.
- [USGS silica](https://www.usgs.gov/centers/national-minerals-information-center/silica-statistics-and-information): quartz crucibles are a real specialized input; the source gives no fixed duration for a future disruption.
- [ClockworkPi uConsole](https://www.clockworkpi.com/uconsole), [Hackberry Pi maker repository](https://github.com/ZitaoTech/Hackberry-Pi_Zero), [Pi hardware documentation](https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/computers/raspberry-pi.html), and [Pi 5 thermal tests](https://www.raspberrypi.com/news/heating-and-cooling-raspberry-pi-5/): kit contents, board/peripheral requirements and workload-dependent cooling.
- [Anthropic redeployment statement](https://www.anthropic.com/news/redeploying-fable-5): company account distinguishes lifting export controls from the different public/partner access arrangements.
- Bibliography additions from sibling agents retain their source notes in `OPENING-REVIEW.md` and `MIDDLE-REVIEW.md`. These were coordinated, not independently recertified twice.

